# Selectext

Read and follow **`cursor.md`** at the repo root for architecture, agent/skills setup, and conventions.

Quick constraints:

- macOS menu-bar Swift app; on-device Vision OCR only; minimal scoped diffs.
- `AppModel` coordinates capture → OCR → clipboard; auxiliary UI via `FeatureWindowController` / `TutorialWindowController`, not menu-only `openWindow`.
- Permissions: one Screen Recording prompt per session; no repeated Accessibility prompts on capture shortcut.
- Issues in `.scratch/`; see `docs/agents/`. Code graph in `graphify-out/` (gitignored).
- New Swift files must be added to `Selectext.xcodeproj`. No commits unless user asks.
